ment per experiment","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"change_expectation","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.copied experiments keep their ids unless the kit holds them, and a clash takes the next free id","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"change_expectation","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.a STUB proxy of the same shape drives the same listing logic","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"rename","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.E1 carries the ordered chain incl. the detector, with the varied polarizer identified within it","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","class":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests","discovery_gate":"constructor-unit-tests","successor":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.E1 references its setup revision and names its varied polarizer with its label","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"rename","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.committing from a scene captures the ordered chain including the detector kind","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","class":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests","discovery_gate":"constructor-unit-tests","successor":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.committing references the setup revision and the varied slot with its label","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"rename","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.the items an experiment uses are those whose model its setup binds, each once","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","class":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests","discovery_gate":"constructor-unit-tests","successor":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.the items an experiment uses are those its setup revision's slots hold, each once","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"delete","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.E2 is constructible without a sample (source + two polarizers + detector)","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"delete","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.versionRefs collects the versioned bindings of the setup (samples yes, presets no)","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"delete","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.pinning an experiment's bound sample version BLOCKS removal of that sample","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"delete","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.editing a PINNED sample version mints the next version instead of rewriting it","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"delete","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"OpticalConstructor.Tests.ExperimentProxyTests.an experiment references the library versions its setup binds, each once","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/ExperimentProxyTests.fs","obligations":["S82-EXPERIMENT-SETUP"]},{"op":"delete","suite":"constructor-unit-tests","id":"