IdOfDomain.fs","obligations":["S115-UNKNOWNS-STEP"]},{"symbol":"OpticalConstructor.Ui.TableAndElementRotationView.ConstructorFlowStep.UnknownsFlowStep","op":"create","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/TableAndElementRotationView.fs","obligations":["S115-UNKNOWNS-STEP"]},{"symbol":"OpticalConstructor.Ui.TableAndElementRotationView.ConstructorFlowStep.stepsOf","op":"change_behavior","obligations":["S115-UNKNOWNS-STEP"],"path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/TableAndElementRotationView.fs"},{"symbol":"OpticalConstructor.Ui.TableAndElementRotationView.TableAndElementRotationModel.studyParameterCaption","op":"create","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/TableAndElementRotationView.fs","obligations":["S115-UNKNOWNS-STEP"]},{"symbol":"OpticalConstructor.Ui.StudyUnknownsView.studyBarView","op":"create","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/StudyUnknownsView.fs","obligations":["S115-UNKNOWNS-STEP"]},{"symbol":"OpticalConstructor.Ui.StudyUnknownsView.studyUnknownsView","op":"create","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/StudyUnknownsView.fs","obligations":["S115-UNKNOWNS-STEP"]},{"symbol":"OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests.TestAppScope.studyKitIn","op":"create","path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/TestAppScope.fs","obligations":["S115-UNKNOWNS-STEP"]},{"symbol":"OpticalConstructor.Ui.KitWindowView.kitWindowView","op":"change_behavior","obligations":["S115-UNKNOWNS-STEP"],"path":"Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/KitWindowView.fs"}],"packages":[],"checks":[]},"section":"S11.5 -- Publishing, the study view; the solver hand-off stub goes"}
{"number": 415, "anchor": "IMPLEMENT", "ac": "AC-S115k", "touches": ["OpticalConstructor.Controls", "OpticalConstructor.Ui", "OpticalConstructor.Tests", "OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests"], "depends_on": [414], "how_to": "The study view's Fit step: the pre-fit check of every run the fit reads, Run joint / Run stage, the running fit's progress with Cancel, and the fit-run history (001 §O 'Study view: … Run joint / Run stage; the fit-run history'; 001 §O 'Automation': `StudyRunFitButton`; 001 §R '`SolverHandoffView`'s stub screen, replaced by the study view. Its three validation checks are reused as the study's pre-fit checks'; .spec-md §10.2 per-iteration progress with Cancel, §10.3 one click with Cancel). It REUSES the study's pre-fit (`Study.prefitWith`, step 377, over the moved checks of step 369) and the fit job the window hosts (step 412). Its position is after Unknowns, where S14.2 inserts Plan between them (001 §O). Each doc is one to three lines citing spec 0050 S11.5. (1) `OpticalConstructor.Ui/TableAndElementRotationView.fs`: `ConstructorFlowStep` gains `FitFlowStep` after `UnknownsFlowStep`, its `caption` `Fit` and its `flowUiId` `flowFitStep`, one of the study's steps (step 414). `StudySurfaceState` (step 410) gains `calibrationUse : CalibrationUse` (step 383), `CalibrationHeldFixed` initially: how stage 2 holds the published calibration. `TableAndElementRotationMsg` gains, each documented in one line, `SelectFitRun of FitRunName`, which sets `fitRunOpt` when the chosen study's `studyFitRuns` hold it and otherwise changes nothing, and `SetStudyCalibrationUse of CalibrationUse`; neither writes. On the model extension holding `studyForwardContext` (step 412): `member model.studyPrefitsOpt : Result<ExperimentPrefit list, StudyForwardError> option`, `None` without a chosen study and otherwise `study.prefitWith model.studyForwardContext <fitted>`, `fitted` being the `dataRead` of the last of `model.studyFitRuns` and `[]` before its first (steps 377, 383), documented in one line. (2) `OpticalConstructor.Controls/UiIds.fs`, a group after the Unknowns step's under `// --- The study's Fit step (StudyFitView). ---`, each with a one-line doc: `flowFitStep` (`\"FlowFitStep\"`), `studyFitPanel` (`\"StudyFitPanel\"`), `studyPrefitList` (`\"StudyPrefitList\"`), `studyRunFitButton` (`\"StudyRunFitButton\"`, 001 §O), `studyRunStageOneButton` (`\"StudyRunStageOneButton\"`), `studyRunStageTwoButton` (`\"StudyRunStageTwoButton\"`), `studyCalibrationFixedChoice` (`\"StudyCalibrationFixedChoice\"`), `studyCalibrationPriorChoice` (`\"StudyCalibrationPriorChoice\"`), `studyFitProgressBar` (`\"StudyFitProgressBar\"`), `studyFitProgressText` (`\"StudyFitProgressText\"`), `studyFitCancelButton` (`\"StudyFitCancelButton\"`), `studyFitErrorText` (`\"StudyFitErrorText\"`) and `fitRunHistory` (`\"FitRunHistory\"`). `ConstructorUiIdOfDomain.fs`: `studyPrefitRow (name : ExperimentName)` is `StudyPrefitRow_<its file stem>` and `fitRunRow (name : FitRunName)` is `FitRunRow_<its file stem>`. (3) New `OpticalConstructor.Ui/StudyFitView.fs`, `module OpticalConstructor.Ui.StudyFitView`, compiled directly after `StudyUnknownsView.fs` (step 414): one `<Compile>` line and no comment. `studyFitView (model) (dispatch) : IView`, its doc one to three lines citing spec 0050 S11.5: a `ScrollViewer` scrolling both ways around a vertical `StackPanel` carrying `studyFitPanel`, margin 8, holding `StudyUnknownsView.studyBarView` and, for the chosen study, in order: (a) `Before the fit:` and a vertical `StackPanel` carrying `studyPrefitList`, one wrapping line per `ExperimentPrefit` of `model.studyPrefitsOpt`, carrying `studyPrefitRow` of its experiment's name: `<name>: ready, <n> point(s)` for `Ok points` (`points.pointCount`, step 300) or `<name>: <the PrefitError's describe>` in `MaterialsWindowView.messageColor`, followed by ` — <the flag's text>` when `changeOpt` holds a flag other than `DataUnchangedFlag` (step 370); a `StudyForwardError` is one line of its `describe` in that colour; no run is the line `The study holds no run a fit reads.`. (b) One horizontal `StackPanel` of `Run joint` (`studyRunFitButton`), `Run stage 1 (calibration)` (`studyRunStageOneButton`) and `Run stage 2 (objects)` (`studyRunStageTwoButton`), `actionButton`s on `positiveBackground` with a right margin as the gap, sending `StudyFit (RunFit { study = study.name; stage = JointStage | CalibrationStage | ObjectStage; calibrationUse = model.studySurface.calibrationUse })` (step 391), present while writes are offered (`model.kitWrites`, step 185) and disabled while `studyFit.job.isRunning`; then `Stage 2 holds the calibration:` and the two boxes `fixed` (`studyCalibrationFixedChoice`) and `as priors` (`studyCalibrationPriorChoice`) of `CalibrationUse.text` (step 383) sending `SetStudyCalibrationUse`, the chosen one on `positiveBackground`. (c) While the job runs: an indeterminate `ProgressBar` carrying `studyFitProgressBar` (iterations have no known total, step 393), `studyFit.job.progressText` in a `TextBlock` carrying `studyFitProgressText` (`JobRunner.fs:JobModel`) and `Cancel` (`studyFitCancelButton`, on `negativeBackground`, sending `StudyFit CancelStudyFit`): progress per iteration, one click with Cancel (.spec-md §10.2, §10.3). (d) `studyFit.errorOpt`'s `describe` in a wrapping `TextBlock` carrying `studyFitErrorText`, in `messageColor`, when `Some`. (e) `Fit runs:` and a vertical `StackPanel` carrying `fitRunHistory`, one box per run of `model.studyFitRuns`, oldest first, carrying `fitRunRow` and reading `<name> — <stage.text>, <engine.text>, <n> run(s)` (step 383), sending `SelectFitRun`, the chosen one on `positiveBackground`; or the line `No fit run yet.`. The completion refresh is step 412's: the job's end re-renders the history with no reload (.spec-md §10.4). (4) `KitWindowView.fs`: `FitFlowStep` shows `StudyFitView.studyFitView model dispatch` keyed `fit`. Tests. `StudyWindowModelTests` gains `the chosen fit run and the calibration use choose what the Fit step shows and runs`: with two fit runs of `QZ-LR` loaded, `SelectFitRun` of the first sets `fitRunOpt` to it, of a name the study lacks changes nothing, and `SetStudyCalibrationUse CalibrationAsPrior` sets the surface's `calibrationUse`; `studyPrefitsOpt` over E1 (attached) and E2 (no data) answers E1's check and E2's `MissingDataErr` in study order. `StudyViewTests` (step 414): `the study view UiIds are the stable intent-named ids` also pins the Fit step's ids; without a trait, `the Fit step offers Run joint and the two stages on one row and lists the study's fit runs, oldest first`: over `studyKitIn` with two test-local fit runs of `QZ-LR` written through `writeFitRun` before its load, on `FitFlowStep`, the three run verbs share one row, left to right, the two calibration-use boxes follow with `fixed` chosen, and `fitRunHistory` holds the two runs' `fitRunRow`s, the older first; with trait `ui-smoke`, `pressing Run joint starts one fit through the shell's host, and Cancel cancels it`: over the same model with the shell's `studyFits` a test-local host recording its jobs and its cancel, pressing `studyRunFitButton` records one job and shows `studyFitProgressBar` and `studyFitCancelButton`, and pressing `studyFitCancelButton` records the cancel. `KitWindowTests`: `the flow strip UiIds are the stable intent-named ids` also pins `FlowFitStep`; `the flow strip shows Items, Setups and Experiments left of the surface its step shows` also finds the Fit box below Unknowns and, on `FitFlowStep`, `studyFitPanel`; `a read-only window withholds every write control` finds in `studyFitView` over the read-only model none of the three run verbs. `KitWindowModelTests`: `the flow strip's steps follow 001's order and a window opens on Setups` lists Items, Setups, Experiments, Data, Unknowns and Fit; `the Data step is the Inverse constructor's alone, and leaving the Inverse constructor leaves it` also finds `stepsOf ForwardConstructor` without Fit. `ScrollExtentTests` gains `the kit window's Fit step leaves everything reachable`: `assertReachable \"KitWindowFit\"` over `kitWindowView` on `FitFlowStep` over `studyKitIn`'s model with three fit runs and a running job (its `studyFit` started through a test-local host and given one `StudyFitProgressed`).", "acceptance": "After the Fit step lands, the Inverse constructor's flow strip MUST show Fit after Unknowns, and `studyFitView` MUST list every run the fit reads with its pre-fit check and data flag, offer Run joint, Run stage 1 and Run stage 2 on one row with the calibration use, show a running fit's progress with Cancel and the error a fit ended with, and list the study's fit runs, every run verb withheld under a read-only kit; constructor-unit-tests MUST pass, including `the chosen fit run and the calibration use choose what the Fit step shows and runs`, the count rising by 1, and the changed `the flow strip's steps follow 001's order and a window opens on Setups` and `the Data step is the Inverse constructor's alone, and leaving the Inverse constructor leaves it`; ui-smoke MUST pass, including `pressing Run joint starts one fit through the shell's host, and Cancel cancels it`, the count rising by 1; ui-tests MUST pass over the selected classes, including `the Fit step offers Run joint and the two stages on one row and lists the study's fit runs, oldest first` and `the kit window's Fit step leaves everything reachable`, the count rising by 2, and the changed `the study view UiIds are the stable intent-named ids`, `the flow strip UiIds are the stable intent-named ids`, `the flow strip shows Items, Setups and Experiments left of the surface its step shows` and `a read-only window withholds every write control`; and build, elevation and the twenty s40 invariants MUST pass.", "required_gates": ["build", "elevation", "constructor-unit-tests", "ui-smoke", "ui-tests"], "gate_selection": {"constructor-unit-tests": {"mode": "all_discovered", "suite": "constructor-unit-tests"}, "ui-smoke": {"mode": "all_discovered", "suite": "ui-smoke"}, "ui-tests": {"mode": "selected", "suite": "ui-tests", "values": ["OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests.KitWindowTests", "OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests.ScrollExtentTests", "OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests.StudyViewTests"]}}, "effects": {"edits": ["Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/TableAndElementRotationView.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Controls/UiIds.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/ConstructorUiIdOfDomain.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/StudyFitView.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/OpticalConstructor.Ui.fsproj", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui/KitWindowView.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/StudyWindowModelTests.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/KitWindowModelTests.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/StudyViewTests.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/KitWindowTests.fs", "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/ScrollExtentTests.fs"], "tests": [{"op": "create", "suite": "constructor-unit-tests", "id": "OpticalConstructor.Tests.StudyWindowModelTests.the chosen fit run and the calibration use choose what the Fit step shows and runs", "path": "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Tests/StudyWindowModelTests.fs", "class": "OpticalConstructor.Tests.StudyWindowModelTests", "discovery_gate": "constructor-unit-tests", "obligations": ["S115-FIT-STEP"]}, {"op": "change_expectation", "suite": "ui-tests", "id": "OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests.StudyViewTests.the study view UiIds are the stable intent-named ids", "path": "Berreman/OpticalConstructor/OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/StudyViewTests.fs", "obligations": ["S115-FIT-STEP"]}, {"op": "create", "suite": "ui-tests", "id": "OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests.StudyViewTests.the Fit step offers Run joint and the two stages on one row and lists the study's fit 